{"seq":1,"slug":"filing-calendar-period-basis","title":"申报日历、税期与计税口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-registration-filing/periodic-filing-remittance/filing-calendar-period-basis","wordCount":2202,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"申报日历-税期与计税口径\">申报日历、税期与计税口径</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-申报是把逐笔交易折叠成一张表-折叠方式由规则决定\">核心概念：申报是把逐笔交易折叠成一张表，折叠方式由规则决定</h2><p>申报表在形式上是一张汇总表，但它不是把流水按国家分组求和。真正发生的事情是<strong>折叠</strong>：一批交易被映射到一个纳税期、一个税基口径、一个税率档、一种交易类型。折叠规则由当地法规规定，而这些规则彼此不通用——同一笔跨境交易在两个辖区可能落在不同的纳税期、进入不同的税基口径。系统的职责是把这些规则显式化、配置化，并保证任一次申报的折叠过程可复现。</p>\n<p>折叠过程中最先需要确定的是<strong>归属时点（time of supply / tax point）</strong>。一笔交易在系统里至少有四个日期：下单日、发货日、开票日、收款日；如果发生退货，还有第五个日期。多数法规规定&quot;货物交付或服务完成时&quot;为纳税义务发生时间，但允许或要求在开票时提前认定，并对预收款、分期付款、持续供应各有特殊规定。选错归属时点的后果不是金额算错，而是交易落进了相邻的纳税期——这会造成两个期间的申报数与系统流水都对不上，而更正跨期数据比改正当期数据昂贵得多。</p>\n<p>第二个决定是<strong>税基口径</strong>。申报表要求税基与税额分列，而税基本身是否含运费、折扣是在税前还是税后扣减、以及退货冲减记在哪一期，各辖区规定不同。第三个决定是<strong>红冲方向</strong>：欧盟多数成员国要求在原交易所属的纳税期冲减，而不是在红冲发生的期次冲减。这条规则使得申报数据的生成不能只看&quot;本期交易&quot;，还必须看&quot;本期发生的红冲所指向的历史交易&quot;，数据模型必须支持从红冲单反查原票的纳税期。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[交易与红冲单据] --&gt; B[确定归属时点&lt;br/&gt;tax point]&#10;  B --&gt; C[映射到纳税期&lt;br/&gt;月/季/年 按当地日历]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按税号归属切分&lt;br/&gt;主体 × 辖区]&#10;  D --&gt; E[按税率档与交易类型分组]&#10;  E --&gt; F[应用税基口径&lt;br/&gt;运费/折扣/含税与否]&#10;  F --&gt; G[红冲按原期冲减]&#10;  G --&gt; H[生成申报数据包&lt;br/&gt;税基 + 税额 + 笔数]&#10;  H --&gt; I[三向对账&lt;br/&gt;引擎/发票/支付]&#10;  I --&gt; J{容差内一致}&#10;  J --&gt;|否| K[差异分类与下钻]&#10;  K --&gt; E&#10;  J --&gt;|是| L[提交申报并留存明细]\">graph TD\n  A[交易与红冲单据] --&gt; B[确定归属时点&lt;br/&gt;tax point]\n  B --&gt; C[映射到纳税期&lt;br/&gt;月/季/年 按当地日历]\n  C --&gt; D[按税号归属切分&lt;br/&gt;主体 × 辖区]\n  D --&gt; E[按税率档与交易类型分组]\n  E --&gt; F[应用税基口径&lt;br/&gt;运费/折扣/含税与否]\n  F --&gt; G[红冲按原期冲减]\n  G --&gt; H[生成申报数据包&lt;br/&gt;税基 + 税额 + 笔数]\n  H --&gt; I[三向对账&lt;br/&gt;引擎/发票/支付]\n  I --&gt; J{容差内一致}\n  J --&gt;|否| K[差异分类与下钻]\n  K --&gt; E\n  J --&gt;|是| L[提交申报并留存明细]</pre><h2 id=\"纳税期的构造与变更\">纳税期的构造与变更</h2><p>纳税期看似简单——&quot;月&quot;&quot;季&quot;&quot;年&quot;——但边界由当地日历决定，且申报频率本身是可以变的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"频率的确定与变更\">频率的确定与变更</h3><p>申报频率通常取决于规模：小规模纳税人是季度或年度，规模上升后强制月度。频率一旦变更，会出现一个<strong>过渡期</strong>：原频率的最后一期可能被截断或延长。例如从季度切到月度，切换当期可能是两个月而不是三个月。这类过渡期在系统里的表现是&quot;该期次的天数不等于标称天数&quot;，因此纳税期的建模应当是**期次实体（period）**而不是按频率实时计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;filing_period&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;per_2026_FR_entity_cn10442_Q2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;jurisdiction&quot;: &quot;FR&quot;,&#10;    &quot;entity_id&quot;: &quot;ent_cn_10442&quot;,&#10;    &quot;tax_identifier_id&quot;: &quot;tid_FR_48910277331&quot;,&#10;    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;2026Q2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;from&quot;: &quot;2026-04-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;to&quot;: &quot;2026-06-30&quot;,&#10;    &quot;due_date&quot;: &quot;2026-07-24&quot;,&#10;    &quot;payment_due_date&quot;: &quot;2026-07-24&quot;,&#10;    &quot;frequency_note&quot;: &quot;transitional: 2-month period after frequency change&quot;,&#10;    &quot;status&quot;: &quot;open&quot;,&#10;    &quot;upstream_refs&quot;: { &quot;previous_period&quot;: null, &quot;next_period&quot;: &quot;per_2026_FR_..._Q3&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"filing_period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per_2026_FR_entity_cn10442_Q2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jurisdiction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"entity_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ent_cn_10442\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tax_identifier_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tid_FR_48910277331\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026Q2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-04-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-06-30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"due_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"payment_due_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"frequency_note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transitional: 2-month period after frequency change\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"upstream_refs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"previous_period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"next_period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per_2026_FR_..._Q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>frequency_note</code> 与 <code>upstream_refs</code> 是关键：它们让&quot;这个期次为什么比标准期短&quot;和&quot;它前后接哪个期&quot;成为可查询的事实，而不是靠人回忆。当税局问&quot;为什么你这期报了两个月的数&quot;时，答案就在记录里。</p>\n<h3 id=\"截止日的算法\">截止日的算法</h3><p>截止日通常是&quot;期末后的第 N 天&quot;，且当该日落在周末或节假日时是否顺延由当地规定决定——很多辖区<strong>不顺延</strong>（英国明确规定截止日仍适用，不论是否为周末或银行假日，见 <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/vat-returns/deadlines\">HMRC 增值税申报与缴款截止日</a> ）。因此截止日必须是<strong>计算出来的具体日期字段</strong>，而不是运行时&quot;期末 + N 天&quot;的动态表达式，因为动态表达式会在节假日场景下给出与法规不一致的结果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>申报类型</th>\n<th>典型截止日算法</th>\n<th>是否顺延</th>\n<th>系统要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>境内定期申报</td>\n<td>期末后 1 个月 + 若干天</td>\n<td>多不顺延</td>\n<td>存具体日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSS 季度申报</td>\n<td>季度结束后次月月末</td>\n<td>视当地而定</td>\n<td>与简化机制绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOSS 月度申报</td>\n<td>次月月末</td>\n<td>视当地而定</td>\n<td>按消费国拆分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年度申报 / 汇总</td>\n<td>次年固定日期</td>\n<td>视当地而定</td>\n<td>与定期申报并存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"计税口径的三组选择\">计税口径的三组选择</h2><p>口径决定的是&quot;同一批交易如何被翻译成申报表字段&quot;，三组选择彼此独立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归属时点-交付-开票还是收款\">归属时点：交付、开票还是收款</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点选择</th>\n<th>适用情形</th>\n<th>跨期风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交付/完成日</td>\n<td>多数货物销售的默认规则</td>\n<td>预售与在途会跨期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开票日</td>\n<td>先开票后发货、或法规要求提前认定</td>\n<td>赊销会提前入期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收款日</td>\n<td>现金制小企业机制</td>\n<td>账期拉长会延后入期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续供应按期</td>\n<td>订阅、持续服务</td>\n<td>需按期分摊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>德国小企业免税采用现金制特征的口径（§19 UStG 的总营业额一般按已收款计算，见 <a href=\"https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/ustg_1980/__19.html\">德国《增值税法》第 19 条</a> ），这正是&quot;时点选择随机制变化&quot;的实例。系统需要在事实表里同时保留多个日期字段，并在申报时按配置选择其中一个，而不是在写入时就丢弃其余时点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"税基构成-运费-折扣与含税价\">税基构成：运费、折扣与含税价</h3><p>税基不等于商品售价。运费是否计入、折扣在哪一步扣减、以及若源数据是含税价如何反推不含税价，都需要显式规则。反推公式本身很直接，但在多税率档混合的订单里必须逐行反推而不是按订单平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>net</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>gross</mtext><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>tax</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>gross</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>net</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{net} = \\frac{\\text{gross}}{1 + r}, \\qquad \\text{tax} = \\text{gross} - \\text{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8769em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gross</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tax</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gross</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是该行适用的税率。如果一张订单含 19% 与 7% 两档商品，对订单总额做一次除法会得到错误的税基；必须按行按税率反推后再汇总。</p>\n<h3 id=\"红冲方向-原期冲减还是本期单列\">红冲方向：原期冲减还是本期单列</h3><p>欧盟多数成员国要求在<strong>原交易所属期</strong>冲减，这意味着申报数据的生成需要沿着&quot;红冲单 → 原票 → 原票所属期&quot;这条链反向查找，并把冲减额挂到历史上那个期次上。工程上这带来一个约束：<strong>已提交的期次不能简单冻结</strong>。它可能被后续期的红冲修改，因此需要两种处理方式之一——修正原期申报（更正申报），或在本期同时报告原交易与红冲（期间调整）。选择哪一种由当地规则决定，系统至少要能同时支持两者。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 计算某期次的应报税基与税额，含&quot;本期红冲指向历史期&quot;的两种处理模式&#10;WITH current_txn AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    tax_rate_code,&#10;    COUNT(*)                        AS txn_count,&#10;    SUM(net_amount)                 AS base_amt,&#10;    SUM(tax_amount)                 AS tax_amt&#10;  FROM tax_transaction_facts&#10;  WHERE tax_point_date BETWEEN :period_from AND :period_to&#10;    AND tax_identifier_id = :tid&#10;  GROUP BY tax_rate_code&#10;),&#10;in_period_credit AS (&#10;  -- 红冲发生在本期、原交易也在本期：直接负项&#10;  SELECT&#10;    f.tax_rate_code,&#10;    COUNT(*)                        AS txn_count,&#10;    -SUM(c.net_amount)              AS base_amt,&#10;    -SUM(c.tax_amount)              AS tax_amt&#10;  FROM tax_credit_notes c&#10;  JOIN tax_transaction_facts f ON f.id = c.original_fact_id&#10;  WHERE c.issue_date BETWEEN :period_from AND :period_to&#10;    AND f.tax_point_date BETWEEN :period_from AND :period_to&#10;  GROUP BY f.tax_rate_code&#10;),&#10;cross_period_credit AS (&#10;  -- 红冲发生在本期、原交易在前一期：按规则决定单列或触发更正&#10;  SELECT&#10;    f.tax_rate_code,&#10;    COUNT(*)                        AS txn_count,&#10;    -SUM(c.net_amount)              AS base_amt,&#10;    -SUM(c.tax_amount)              AS tax_amt,&#10;    f.tax_point_date::date          AS original_period_ref&#10;  FROM tax_credit_notes c&#10;  JOIN tax_transaction_facts f ON f.id = c.original_fact_id&#10;  WHERE c.issue_date BETWEEN :period_from AND :period_to&#10;    AND f.tax_point_date &lt; :period_from&#10;  GROUP BY f.tax_rate_code, f.tax_point_date::date&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#39;current&#39; AS bucket, * FROM current_txn&#10;UNION ALL SELECT &#39;in_period_credit&#39;, * FROM in_period_credit&#10;UNION ALL SELECT &#39;cross_period_credit&#39;, * FROM cross_period_credit;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 计算某期次的应报税基与税额，含\"本期红冲指向历史期\"的两种处理模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_txn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tax_rate_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_amount)                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_amt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tax_amount)                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tax_amt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tax_transaction_facts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tax_point_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tax_identifier_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :tid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tax_rate_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">in_period_credit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 红冲发生在本期、原交易也在本期：直接负项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_rate_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dar